    <id>http://arxiv.org/abs/2105.00386v1</id>
    <title>Images of Linear Derivations and Linear E-derivations of K[x 1 ,x 2 ,x 3 ]</title>
    <updated>2021-05-02T04:09:00Z</updated>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2105.00386v1" rel="alternate" type="text/html"/>
    <link href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2105.00386v1" rel="related" type="application/pdf" title="pdf"/>
    <summary>Let K be a field of characteristic zero. We prove that images of a linear K-derivation and a linear K-E-derivation of the ring K[x 1 ,x 2 ,x 3 ] of polynomial in three variables over K are Mathieu-Zhao subspaces, which affirms the LFED conjecture for linear K-derivations and linear K-E-derivations of K[x 1 ,x 2 ,x 3 ].</summary>
